WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.470
Welcome, welcome to the
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:04.604
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:07.039
Well, guys, the election
is five days away,

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:09.542
and President Trump is busy
on the campaign trail.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.477
At one of his rallies,
he tried to describe

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:13.612
what would happen
if Joe Biden wins.

00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:14.947
Listen to this.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:18.684
-If you vote for Biden,
it means no kids in school,

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:22.421
no graduations, no weddings,
no Thanksgiving,

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.757
no Christmas...
-[ Crowd booing ]

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.692
-...and no Fourth of July
together.

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:28.895
Other than that,
you have a wonderful life.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.430
-Yeah. Yeah, a wonderful life.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.165
[as George Bailey]
"Merry Christmas,

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.233
closed-down movie theaters!

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.937
Uh, w-- Merry Christmas,
boarded-up schools!

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.773
Merry Christmas,
abandoned gyms!"

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:42.341
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:44.644
It's already a wonderful life,
except every time a bell rings,

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.012
someone gets COVID.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:47.513
[ Crew groaning ]

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:49.015
No Christmas?

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:52.317
Does Trump think he's running
against Biden or the Grinch?

00:00:52.317 --> 00:00:53.853
Later, Trump was like,

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:58.991
"A vote for Biden
mean no Toyotathon!

00:00:58.991 --> 00:01:02.228
No Happy Honda Days.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.064
No Lexus December to Remember."

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:06.232
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.968
[ Applause ]

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.736
According to Trump,
electing Biden

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:12.505
will lead to riots
in the streets,

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.640
an economy in the tank,
and no holidays,

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.576
but, also,
he's a sleepy politician

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:18.878
who can't get anything done.

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:21.113
But this is interesting.
Today, Trump and Biden

00:01:21.113 --> 00:01:23.215
were both campaigning
down in Tampa, Florida.

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:25.250
People in Tampa were like,
"Come on. We just

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:28.021
lost the World Series.
Now we got to deal with this?"

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:30.289
I'm glad both guys
were in the same place 'cause

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:32.625
it finally ends my uncle's
conspiracy theory that Trump

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.595
and Biden are actually
the same lizard person.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:39.232
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.267
Yep, Trump went to Tampa.
And this was nice --

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:43.169
he brought some frozen
Nebraska supporters

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.771
so they could thaw out.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.473
Isn't that nice?

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:48.241
As for Trump,
you can tell his campaign

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.942
is low on money
'cause he asked Biden

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:53.413
if he wanted to split an Uber
back to the airport.

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:57.183
In a new poll, I saw that Biden
is up 4 points in Florida.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.685
Meanwhile, Tucker Carlson
claims that he has polls

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:02.188
that show Trump ahead,
but they got lost in the mail.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:04.390
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.592
Of course, the other big story
is the pandemic,

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:09.862
and it just came out that it's
even affecting the Space Force.

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:11.431
Listen to this.

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:13.999
-One of the highest-ranking
members of the Space Force

00:02:13.999 --> 00:02:16.001
has tested positive
for the coronavirus.

00:02:16.001 --> 00:02:17.836
The Vice Chief
of Space Operations,

00:02:17.836 --> 00:02:21.541
General David D. Thompson,
diagnosed yesterday.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:23.042
-Yeah. I hope he's alright.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.977
But I think the country
will be okay.

00:02:24.977 --> 00:02:26.712
Vice President
of the Space Force

00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:29.549
is like being the vice
president of a darts league.

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.417
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:32.885
But this is smart --

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:34.620
just to play it safe,
the rest of the Space Force

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.088
will be working from home

00:02:36.088 --> 00:02:38.391
instead of their usual
strip-mall office.

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:41.360
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.195
Why do I feel like
we're one day away from hearing,

00:02:43.195 --> 00:02:48.033
"My fellow Americans,
the coronavirus is now in space.

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:51.504
Been one hell of a ride."

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:55.875
I like the way the anchor said
"Space Force."

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:58.978
She was almost, like,
mocking it or something, right?

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:00.747
-Together: Space Force!

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.514
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.514 --> 00:03:04.550
-Dave, could we --
Dave, can we play that

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.285
one more time
and hear that again?

00:03:06.285 --> 00:03:09.388
-One of the highest-ranking
members of the Space Force

00:03:09.388 --> 00:03:11.057
has tested positive...

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:15.061
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.763
-Space Force!

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:18.665
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:24.136
I saw that Bed Bath &amp; Beyond
just made a big announcement

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:27.506
about their famous coupons.
Take a look.

00:03:27.506 --> 00:03:30.609
-Bed Bath &amp; Beyond planning
to scale back these coupons

00:03:30.609 --> 00:03:32.512
in an effort to boost profits

00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:34.313
and be more competitive
on pricing.

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:35.781
Don't worry, though --

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:38.384
the coupons promising
15% or 20% off,

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:40.320
they're not going away entirely.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:44.457
They just might not appear
in your mailbox quite as often.

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:45.925
-Ah. That's devastating

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:47.826
'cause now parents
will have nothing to jam

00:03:47.826 --> 00:03:50.897
in the corner
of their kitchen counters.

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:53.132
Yep, in 2020,
even your junk drawer

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:56.001
is going through
an identity crisis.

00:03:56.001 --> 00:03:59.372
"Without the coupons,
who...am I?"

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.706
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.706 --> 00:04:02.675
It's kind of sad 'cause
if Pottery Barn stops

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:05.178
sending catalogs,
then there will be no more mail.

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:07.280
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.881
Now, this is interesting --

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.816
Harley-Davidson
just introduced something new,

00:04:10.816 --> 00:04:13.118
and it's taking a lot of people
by surprise. Watch this.

00:04:13.118 --> 00:04:15.254
-Harley-Davidson
has a new product.

00:04:15.254 --> 00:04:17.256
It is an electric bike,
but look at that.

00:04:17.256 --> 00:04:21.594
It's not an electric motorcycle.
It's an electric bicycle!

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:23.596
-Yeah, Moms heard that
and were like,

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:25.231
"Yeah, it's still a no."

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:27.033
"But I'm 48!"

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:29.669
"Yeah, no."

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:32.138
I'm actually looking forward
to seeing the first biker gang

00:04:32.138 --> 00:04:36.009
that takes breaks
for matcha-tea smoothies.

00:04:36.009 --> 00:04:38.143
Yeah, you don't look
quite as badass

00:04:38.143 --> 00:04:39.511
in a Hell's Angels jacket

00:04:39.511 --> 00:04:41.514
when you're riding
Peewee Herman's bike.

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:43.282
[as Peewee] Hah-hah!
[Giggles]

00:04:43.282 --> 00:04:45.784 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:45.784 --> 00:04:49.188
No hands! No hands!
Hah-hah! Hmm-hmm!

00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:50.889
[Peewee giggle]

00:04:50.889 --> 00:04:52.492
[ Questlove laughing ]

00:04:52.492 --> 00:04:54.393
-Wait. Stop.

00:04:54.393 --> 00:04:57.529
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.529 --> 00:05:00.966
-I broke him. I broke him.
This is cool right here.

00:05:00.966 --> 00:05:03.536
There's going to be a blue moon
on Halloween this year.

00:05:03.536 --> 00:05:05.170
So Denny's is celebrating
by selling

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:08.474
a ham, egg, and cheese sandwich
with blue bread. Look at this.

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:11.143
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.143 --> 00:05:12.678
Ah, yes, the classic color

00:05:12.678 --> 00:05:15.414
everyone associates
with Halloween -- blue.

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:17.816
[ Laughter ]

00:05:17.816 --> 00:05:19.852
So, remember, even though
Halloween is basically canceled,

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:22.188
you can still make it
much, much worse.

00:05:22.188 --> 00:05:25.091
But get this. Even though
some people are skipping

00:05:25.091 --> 00:05:27.026
Halloween, sales of candy
and chocolate

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:30.028
are up more than 8%
compared to last year.

00:05:30.028 --> 00:05:32.065
Yep, the only chocolate bar
that isn't selling well

00:05:32.065 --> 00:05:34.000
is Hershey's Whatchamacovid.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.135
[ Laughter ]

00:05:36.135 --> 00:05:37.703
Not selling.

00:05:37.703 --> 00:05:40.672
[ Applause ]

00:05:40.672 --> 00:05:42.774
And, finally, you got see this.

00:05:42.774 --> 00:05:45.211
To make trick-or-treating safer
during the pandemic,

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:47.680
a lot of people
have built candy cannons.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.849
Candy cannons.
Take a look at this.

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:52.217
-John Downs
built this candy cannon.

00:05:52.217 --> 00:05:55.488
He says it is designed to keep
kids safe and socially distant.

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:57.490
The cannon is 12 feet tall.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:00.626
At the press of a button,
it uses a shop vacuum

00:06:00.626 --> 00:06:04.096
to shoot the candy
down the tube.

00:06:04.096 --> 00:06:05.497
-That's a weird phrase.

00:06:05.497 --> 00:06:08.835
"To keep trick-or-treating safe,
we're introducing cannons."

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:11.003
[ Laughter ]

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:12.604
Personally,
I'll be loading gumballs

00:06:12.604 --> 00:06:13.973
into a pitching machine.

00:06:13.973 --> 00:06:17.376
FTOO-FTOO-FTOO-FTOO-FTOO-FTOO!

00:06:17.376 --> 00:06:20.245
In other news, Candy Cannons
will be dancing

00:06:20.245 --> 00:06:21.814
on the main stage tonight

00:06:21.814 --> 00:06:24.483
at Stiletto's
in East Rutherford.

00:06:24.483 --> 00:06:26.218
[ Laughter ]

00:06:26.218 --> 00:06:29.389
We have a great show. Give it up
for The Roots, everybody!

